  2+  8630              ;
  3+  8630              ; Printing a run of text, breaking it between words.
  4+  8630              ;
  5+  8630              ; This knows nothing about any screen beyond how wide it is and where the
  6+  8630              ; cursor sits, both of which the machine's own screen layer names, so every
  7+  8630              ; machine shares it.
  8+  8630
  9+  8630              ; Print BC characters from HL, breaking between words so none is split.
 10+  8630              ; Corrupts: AF, BC, DE, HL
